msgstr "..."

#: script/space.js:1129
msgid "...."
msgstr "...."

#: script/graveyard.js:65
msgid "\"a physician. she treated both sides and said so out loud.\""
msgstr "\"ārste. viņa ārstēja abas puses un to teica skaļi.\""

#: script/swamp.js:81
msgid "\"and then a door was opened. i was not there. i have had a great deal of time to be grateful that i was not there.\""
msgstr "\"un tad tika atvērtas durvis. es tur nebiju. man bija daudz laika, lai būtu pateicīgs, ka tur nebiju.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:110
msgid "\"curse the profane for all time, and curse the exile for releasing them.\""
msgstr "\"lai mūžīgi nolādēts ir zaimotājs, un lai nolādēts izsūtītais, kas viņu atbrīvoja.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:41
msgid "\"curse the profane, who was told what would happen and did it anyway.\""
msgstr "\"lai nolādēts zaimotājs, kuram tika teikts, kas notiks, un viņš to tomēr izdarīja.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:76
#: script/graveyard.js:81
#: script/graveyard.js:86
#: script/graveyard.js:91
#: script/graveyard.js:96
msgid "\"curse the profane.\""
msgstr "\"lai nolādēts zaimotājs.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:35
msgid "\"fell in the first bombardment, with the roof of his own house.\""
msgstr "\"krita pirmajā bombardēšanā, zem sava paša mājas jumta.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1863
msgid "\"forcing your will through violence? you have only proven why you deserve to be shunned.\""
msgstr "\"savu gribu uzspiest ar vardarbību? tu tikai pierādīji, kāpēc esi pelnījis izstumšanu.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:40
msgid "\"four years old. the sky came down.\""
msgstr "\"četrus gadus vecs. debesis nokrita.\""

#: script/swamp.js:137
msgid "\"go home, commander.\""
msgstr "\"ej mājās, komandier.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:60
msgid "\"he stood at the profane's shoulder for nine years.\""
msgstr "\"viņš stāvēja zaimotājam blakus deviņus gadus.\""

#: script/space.js:1049
msgid "\"i could never have done any of this without you. but you would never understand.\""
msgstr "\"es nekad nebūtu spējis to visu izdarīt bez tevis. bet tu nekad nesaprastu.\""

#: script/swamp.js:93
msgid "\"i have made my peace with never leaving. i recommend it. it is the only thing out here that gets easier.\""
msgstr "\"es esmu samierinājies, ka nekad neaizbraukšu. iesaku to. tā ir vienīgā lieta šeit, kas kļūst vieglāka.\""

#: script/swamp.js:147
msgid "\"i have made my peace with never leaving. you have not. that is the whole of the difference between us.\""
msgstr "\"es esmu samierinājies, ka nekad neaizbraukšu. tu neesi. tā ir visa atšķirība starp mums.\""

#: script/space.js:978
msgid "\"i told you i had made my peace with never leaving,\" he says. \"i would like to formally revise that.\""
msgstr "\"es tev teicu, ka esmu samierinājies, ka nekad neaizbraukšu,\" viņš saka. \"es vēlētos to oficiāli pārskatīt.\""

#: script/swamp.js:75
msgid "\"i was second. whatever he signed, i countersigned.\""
msgstr "\"es biju otrais. ko viņš parakstīja, to es parakstīju līdzās.\""

#: script/swamp.js:135
msgid "\"keep it. you will not remember this and you will need something to be holding when you work it out again.\""
msgstr "\"paturi to. tu to neatcerēsies, un tev būs kaut kas jātur, kad atkal to sapratīsi.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:70
msgid "\"lost with all hands, orbital action.\""
msgstr "\"pazudis ar visu apkalpi, orbitālā kaujā.\""

#: script/easterEggs.js:127
msgid "\"nothing.\""
msgstr "\"nekas.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:75
msgid "\"one of the many. there was not time to find out which.\""
msgstr "\"viens no daudziem. nebija laika noskaidrot, kurš.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:51
msgid "\"one of the nine reported it. the profane had her executed inside the week.\""
msgstr "\"viena no deviņiem to ziņoja. zaimotājs lika viņu nogalināt nedēļas laikā.\""

#: script/easterEggs.js:134
msgid "\"one weighed down with the weight of the stars in a prison without walls.\""
msgstr "\"viens, kuru spiež zvaigžņu smagums cietumā bez sienām.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1884
msgid "\"perhaps judgement will not be everlasting.\""
msgstr "\"varbūt spriedums nebūs mūžīgs.\""

#: script/swamp.js:125
msgid "\"she has been out here as long as i have and she did not have to be.\""
msgstr "\"viņa šeit ir bijusi tikpat ilgi kā es, lai gan viņai tas nebija jādara.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:50
msgid "\"she said in a room of nine people that the war should stop.\""
msgstr "\"deviņu cilvēku klātbūtnē viņa teica, ka karam jābeidzas.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:30
msgid "\"she went out when the call came. she believed it. that was the whole of her crime.\""
msgstr "\"viņa devās ārā, kad atnāca aicinājums. viņa tam ticēja. tas bija viss viņas noziegums.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3256
#: script/events/setpieces.js:3340
msgid "\"spend it on what will still be here after us.\""
msgstr "\"iztērē to tam, kas šeit paliks pēc mums.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:31
msgid "\"taken in the rising. curse the profane.\""
msgstr "\"paņemts sacelšanās laikā. lai nolādēts zaimotājs.\""

#: script/easterEggs.js:128
msgid "\"that is not a judgement.\""
msgstr "\"tas nav spriedums.\""

#: script/swamp.js:131
msgid "\"that is the part i had to make peace with. not that it was cruel. that it stopped being about us a very long time ago and did not stop.\""
msgstr "\"ar šo daļu man bija jāsamierinās. ne jau ar to, ka tas bija nežēlīgi. bet ka tas jau sen pārstāja būt par mums, un tas neapstājās.\""

#: script/swamp.js:120
msgid "\"that is worse. i know it is worse. i countersigned all of it and it is worse for me too.\""
msgstr "\"tas ir sliktāk. es zinu, ka tas ir sliktāk. es visu to parakstīju līdzās, un man arī ir sliktāk.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:55
msgid "\"the convoys stopped coming. it took the settlement eleven weeks.\""
msgstr "\"konvoji pārstāja ierasties. apmetne izturēja vienpadsmit nedēļas.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:66
msgid "\"the profane had that called treason. curse him.\""
msgstr "\"zaimotājs to sauca par nodevību. lai viņš top nolādēts.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:56
msgid "\"the profane needed the lanes for something else. curse him for it.\""
msgstr "\"zaimotājam ceļi bija vajadzīgi kaut kam citam. lai viņš par to top nolādēts.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2055
msgid "\"the watcher does not pass judgement.\""
msgstr "\"vērotājs neizsaka spriedumu.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2056
msgid "\"the watcher observes judgement.\""
msgstr "\"vērotājs vēro spriedumu.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1991
msgid "\"the watcher would not forbid someone from observing their own fate.\""
msgstr "\"vērotājs neaizliegtu kādam vērot savu paša likteni.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:61
msgid "\"the wound is in his back. curse the profane, who could not even do that much to a man's face.\""
msgstr "\"brūce ir viņa mugurā. lai nolādēts zaimotājs, kurš nespēja to izdarīt pat vīram sejā.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2364
msgid "\"there is a fire at home. it is still lit. that is all i have to offer and i am offering it.\""
msgstr "\"mājās deg uguns. tā vēl aizvien deg. tas ir viss, ko varu piedāvāt, un es to piedāvāju.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2363
msgid "\"there is nothing in there but pain. i am not going to pretend i can stop you.\""
msgstr "\"tur iekšā nav nekā, izņemot sāpes. es neizlikšos, ka varu tevi apturēt.\""

#: script/swamp.js:115
msgid "\"there is nothing left in you to lose. and some of what you have got left, you are holding shut on purpose. i can see you doing it.\""
msgstr "\"tevī vairs nav ko zaudēt. un daļu no tā, kas tev vēl palicis, tu ar nolūku turi slēgtu. es to redzu.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:46
msgid "\"there was no end to them. the profane never intended one.\""
msgstr "\"tiem nebija gala. zaimotājs to nekad nemaz nav plānojis.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:36
msgid "\"there was no warning given. the profane did not consider one necessary.\""
msgstr "\"nekāds brīdinājums netika dots. zaimotājs neuzskatīja to par nepieciešamu.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3716
msgid "\"THEY SHOWED ME A THING THAT CANNOT BE TRUE. I KNEW IT WAS TRUE THE MOMENT I SAW IT. I HAVE NOT BEEN ABLE TO PUT IT DOWN SINCE.\""
msgstr "\"MAN PARĀDĪJA LIETU, KAS NEVAR BŪT PATIESA. ES ZINĀJU, KA TĀ IR PATIESA, TIKLĪDZ TO IEROVIJU. KOPŠ TĀ LAIKA ES TO NEVARU AIZMIRST.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:71
msgid "\"they were not told what they were firing on. curse the profane, who was.\""
msgstr "\"viņiem netika teikts, uz ko viņi šauj. lai nolādēts zaimotājs, kurš to zināja.\""

#: script/space.js:1012
#: script/space.js:1033
#: script/space.js:984
#: script/space.js:989
msgid "\"to know someone is to love someone. you cannot help who you love.\""
msgstr "\"pazīt kādu nozīmē mīlēt kādu. tu nevari izvēlēties, ko mīlēt.\""

#: script/graveyard.js:45
msgid "\"twenty-one years in the wars. he was released twice and recalled twice.\""
msgstr "\"divdesmit viens gads karos. viņš tika atbrīvots divreiz un atsaukts atpakaļ divreiz.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3254
msgid "\"we did not arrive together and we will not leave together. the water is one water.\""
msgstr "\"mēs neieradāmies kopā un neaizbrauksim kopā. ūdens ir viens ūdens.\""

#: script/swamp.js:69
msgid "\"we did not think we were monsters. that is not a defence. it is just what was true.\""
msgstr "\"mēs nedomājām, ka esam briesmoņi. tas nav attaisnojums. tā vienkārši bija patiesība.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2020
msgid "\"we do not ask the watcher to change fate, merely to help us understand it.\""
msgstr "\"mēs nelūdzam vērotājam mainīt likteni, tikai palīdzēt to saprast.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2019
msgid "\"we help those in need if we are able, but our path is to watch, not to intervene.\""
msgstr "\"mēs palīdzam trūkumcietējiem, ja spējam, bet mūsu ceļš ir vērot, nevis iejaukties.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1953
msgid "\"we help those in need if we are able.\""
msgstr "\"mēs palīdzam trūkumcietējiem, ja spējam.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1883
msgid "\"we perceive the penitent.\""
msgstr "\"mēs uztveram nožēlotāju.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1992
msgid "\"we would be poor students of it if we did.\""
msgstr "\"mēs būtu slikti tā mācekļi, ja tā darītu.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1994
msgid "\"what is down there is not a secret. it is only difficult.\""
msgstr "\"tas, kas tur lejā, nav noslēpums. tas ir vienkārši grūti.\""

#: script/swamp.js:87
msgid "\"you are holding its mark in your hand. that is where it ended up.\""
msgstr "\"tu turi tā zīmi savā rokā. tur tā ir nonākusi.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2079
msgid "\"you are who you always are. this is why you are shunned.\""
msgstr "\"tu esi tas, kas vienmēr esi bijis. tāpēc tevi izstumj.\""

#: script/events/encounters.js:1703
msgid "\"you did not bring anybody either.\""
msgstr "\"tu arī nevienu neatvedi.\""

#: script/swamp.js:107
msgid "\"you have the scar. you always have the scar.\""
msgstr "\"tev ir rēta. tev vienmēr ir bijusi rēta.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2760
msgid "\"you may observe your fate.\""
msgstr "\"tu vari vērot savu likteni.\""

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2761
msgid "\"you may rarely change it.\""
msgstr "\"tu vari to reti mainīt.\""

#: script/swamp.js:109
msgid "\"you never remember. i have stopped finding that surprising and i have not stopped minding it.\""
msgstr "\"tu nekad neatceries. man tas vairs nešķiet pārsteidzoši, bet man tas joprojām nav vienaldzīgi.\""

#: script/room.js:270
msgid "{0} could help hunt, given the means"
msgstr "{0} varētu palīdzēt medīt, ja būtu līdzekļi"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3457
msgid "{0} of the three are dark now. what is left is still lit."
msgstr "{0} no trim tagad ir izdzisušas. atlikusī vēl deg."

#: script/engine.js:1279
msgid "{0} per {1}s"
msgstr "{0} katras {1}s"

#: script/outside.js:1701
