msgstr "saka, ka sekas nav draudi, ko viņš izsaka. tās ir kaut kas, kas jau ir sācies, un tu to sajutīsi kā veiksmi, kas pagriezusies pret tevi, un tu to sauksi par veiksmi."

#: script/events/room.js:1189
msgid "says every settlement gives her a different name, and the older the settlement, the less certain they are."
msgstr "saka, ka katra apmetne viņai dod citu vārdu, un jo vecāka apmetne, jo mazāk viņi ir pārliecināti."

#: script/events/room.js:911
msgid "says everything you do out here is done in front of somebody, and that they carry it further than you do."
msgstr "saka, ka viss, ko tu šeit dari, tiek darīts kāda klātbūtnē, un ka viņi to nes tālāk nekā tu."

#: script/events/room.js:457
msgid "says he can build you a hut for less wood"
msgstr "saka, ka var uzcelt tev būdu ar mazāk koka"

#: script/events/room.js:926
msgid "says he has been to three settlements this season and your name came up at two of them, and not well."
msgstr "saka, ka šosezon bijis trīs apmetnēs, un tavs vārds izskanējis divās no tām, un ne labi."

#: script/swamp.js:113
msgid "says he has gone perhaps a dozen times, and each one took a little off the top, and he can still tell you the name of the ship he was born on."
msgstr "saka, ka gājis varbūt duci reižu, un katra no tām nedaudz noņēmusi no augšas, un viņš vēl aizvien var pateikt tā kuģa vārdu, kurā piedzimis."

#: script/events/room.js:943
msgid "says he has seen someone do all of this before, at a scale you would not believe, and that they are still paying for it."
msgstr "saka, ka viņš agrāk redzējis kādu darām to visu tādā mērogā, kam tu neticētu, un ka viņi joprojām par to maksā."

#: script/events/path.js:537
msgid "says he is going to walk until he reaches the edge of it. says he has worked out that there has to be one."
msgstr "saka, ka staigās, līdz sasniegs tās malu. saka, ka izdomājis, ka malai jābūt."

#: script/space.js:980
msgid "says he is prepared to follow you again, if you will have him. says the last time did not go especially well and that he has had four hundred centuries to think about what he would do differently."
msgstr "saka, ka gatavs tev sekot atkal, ja viņu pieņemsi. saka, ka pēdējo reizi nebija īpaši veiksmīga un ka viņam bijuši četri simti gadsimtu, lai pārdomātu, ko darītu citādi."

#: script/events/room.js:941
msgid "says he knows what you have been doing. says everyone between here and the flats knows what you have been doing."
msgstr "saka, ka zina, ko tu esi darījis. saka, ka visi no šejienes līdz līdzenumiem zina, ko tu esi darījis."

#: script/swamp.js:73
msgid "says he served under a commander he would have followed anywhere and largely did."
msgstr "saka, ka kalpojis pie komandiera, kuram sekotu jebkur, un lielākoties tā arī darīja."

#: script/swamp.js:92
msgid "says he was one. says there was one other, and she is not here, and he does not say more than that."
msgstr "saka, ka viņš bija viens no tiem. saka, ka bija vēl viena, un viņas šeit nav, un viņš nesaka vairāk par to."

#: script/swamp.js:136
msgid "says he will be here. says that is not a promise, it is just the only fact he has left."
msgstr "saka, ka viņš būs šeit. saka, ka tas nav solījums, tas ir vienīgais fakts, kas viņam palicis."

#: script/room.js:2129
msgid "says in that case the huts should be built to last, and that she knows how, given steel."
msgstr "saka, ka tādā gadījumā būdas jābūvē tā, lai izturētu, un ka viņa zina kā, ja būs tērauds."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2452
msgid "says it can't die."
msgstr "saka, ka tas nevar nomirt."

#: script/events/outside.js:168
msgid "says it is not the first thing she has had to rebuild. says that is not much comfort and offers it anyway."
msgstr "saka, ka tas nav pirmais, kas viņai bijis jāatjauno. saka, ka tas maz mierina, un tomēr to piedāvā."

#: script/room.js:2130
msgid "says people work better when they are not waiting for the roof to come down."
msgstr "saka, ka cilvēki strādā labāk, kad negaida jumta sabrukšanu."

#: script/events/road.js:666
msgid "says she has stopped believing the answers and started keeping a list of who gave them."
msgstr "saka, ka viņa vairs netic atbildēm un ir sākusi vest sarakstu, kurš tās sniedza."

#: script/room.js:2114
msgid "says she has watched people follow you before. says she has watched what it cost them."
msgstr "saka, ka jau agrāk redzējusi cilvēkus tev sekojam. saka, ka viņa redzējusi, ko tas viņiem maksāja."

#: script/events/road.js:665
msgid "says she is going to go back and ask better questions."
msgstr "saka, ka viņa atgriezīsies un uzdos labākus jautājumus."

#: script/events/road.js:664
msgid "says she is going to try north next, when she can walk properly."
msgstr "saka, ka nākamreiz mēģinās ziemeļus, kad varēs pienācīgi staigāt."

#: script/events/room.js:1135
msgid "says she is making a register of settlements. asks what this one is called."
msgstr "saka, ka veido apmetņu reģistru. jautā, kā šī saucas."

#: script/room.js:2075
msgid "says she is not asking to be difficult. says the answer changes what she builds next."
msgstr "saka, ka nejautā, lai būtu grūta. saka, ka atbilde maina to, ko viņa būvēs nākamreiz."

#: script/events/road.js:662
msgid "says she walked east because the last three people she asked all said something different, and east was the only direction nobody had ruled out."
msgstr "saka, ka gāja uz austrumiem, jo pēdējie trīs cilvēki, ko viņa jautāja, visi teica ko citu, un austrumi bija vienīgais virziens, ko neviens nebija izslēdzis."

#: script/events/room.js:1778
msgid "says thank you once, plainly, and then talks about something else for the rest of the evening."
msgstr "pateicas vienreiz, vienkārši, un tad runā par kaut ko citu visu atlikušo vakaru."

#: script/events/room.js:883
msgid "says that is worth more than any of the three things he taught you, and that it took longer to earn."
msgstr "saka, ka tas ir vairāk vērts nekā jebkura no trim lietām, ko viņš tev mācīja, un ka to nopelnīt prasīja ilgāk."

#: script/events/room.js:882
msgid "says that people out here talk, and that what they say about this village has started arriving before you do."
msgstr "saka, ka cilvēki šeit runā, un ka tas, ko viņi saka par šo ciematu, sāk pienākt jau pirms tevis."

#: script/events/road.js:669
msgid "says that sometimes all you can do is commit to a direction to avoid madness."
msgstr "saka, ka dažreiz vienīgais, ko vari darīt, ir apņemties virzienu, lai izvairītos no vājprāta."

#: script/swamp.js:74
msgid "says the commander was not cruel. says that is what made the rest of it possible -- nobody follows a monster in those numbers."
msgstr "saka, ka komandieris nebija nežēlīgs. saka, ka tieši tas ļāva notikt pārējam -- neviens tik daudz cilvēku nesekotu briesmonim."

#: script/events/road.js:668
msgid "says the compass in your hand shows more than hers."
msgstr "saka, ka kompass tavā rokā rāda vairāk nekā viņas."

#: script/swamp.js:130
msgid "says the cycle is not a punishment anybody is still administering. says whoever passed the sentence is four hundred centuries dead and the machine is simply still running."
msgstr "saka, ka cikls nav sods, ko kāds joprojām piemēro. saka, ka lai kas pieņēma spriedumu, tas ir miris jau četri simti gadsimtu, un mašīna vienkārši joprojām darbojas."

#: script/swamp.js:86
msgid "says the fleet is gone. not scattered -- gone. says there is no wanderer society left to go back to, and that most of what is buried on this rock is the last of it."
msgstr "saka, ka flotes vairs nav. ne izklīdusi -- vairs nav. saka, ka nav palikusi klejotāju sabiedrība, uz kuru atgriezties, un ka lielākā daļa no tā, kas apbedīts šajā klintī, ir tās pēdējie atlikumi."

#: script/events/room.js:1190
msgid "says the oldest ones do not give a name at all. they just point at the ground."
msgstr "saka, ka vecākie vispār nedod vārdu. viņi vienkārši norāda uz zemi."

#: script/space.js:979
msgid "says the terms were never as fixed as he let you believe. says he stayed because he had nowhere he would rather be broken, and that this, apparently, is not that any more."
msgstr "saka, ka noteikumi nekad nebija tik nemainīgi, kā viņš tev lika domāt. saka, ka viņš palika, jo nebija vietas, kur labāk tikt salauztam, un ka tas, šķiet, vairs nav tā."

#: script/room.js:2115
msgid "says the traps will still fill. says she can salt what comes out of them, and that two people do not need a village to feed them."
msgstr "saka, ka slazdi joprojām piepildīsies. saka, ka viņa var sālīt to, kas no tiem nāk, un ka diviem cilvēkiem nav vajadzīgs ciemats, lai viņus barotu."

#: script/events/room.js:897
msgid "says the trick is what you are still willing to do by the time you have."
msgstr "saka, ka triks ir tas, ko tu joprojām esi gatavs darīt tad, kad tev jau ir."

#: script/events/room.js:913
msgid "says the wild is not the thing that decides how this goes."
msgstr "saka, ka ne tuksnesis izlemj, kā tas notiks."

#: script/swamp.js:67
msgid "says the worlds were not empty. says that is the part people leave out when they tell it."
msgstr "saka, ka pasaules nebija tukšas. saka, ka tā ir daļa, ko cilvēki izlaiž, stāstot to."

#: script/swamp.js:79
msgid "says there was another after that. one who thought the fleets were being wasted on conquest that stopped."
msgstr "saka, ka pēc tam bija vēl viens. tāds, kas domāja, ka flotes tiek izšķērdētas iekarojumam, kas apstājās."

#: script/swamp.js:80
msgid "says they locked that one up, and they were right to, and everyone agreed, and it held for a long time."
msgstr "saka, ka viņi to ieslodzīja, un viņiem bija taisnība to darīt, un visi piekrita, un tas turējās ilgu laiku."

#: script/events/outside.js:846
msgid "says this world is the only one that never got a name, and that is why they are all still on it."
msgstr "saka, ka šī pasaule ir vienīgā, kas nekad nesaņēma vārdu, un tāpēc viņi visi joprojām ir tur."

#: script/events/path.js:572
msgid "says two of them went anyway."
msgstr "saka, ka divi no viņiem tomēr aizgāja."

#: script/events/room.js:898
msgid "says you are doing better at that than most, and that most is not a high bar, and that he means it kindly."
msgstr "saka, ka tev tas padodas labāk nekā vairumam, un ka vairums nav augsta latiņa, un ka viņš to saka labestīgi."

#: script/events/road.js:667
msgid "says you cant always trust your memory of where you have been before. take notes."
msgstr "saka, ka ne vienmēr vari uzticēties savai atmiņai par to, kur esi bijis agrāk. jāraksta piezīmes."

#: script/events/room.js:912
msgid "says you have a reputation. says it is not a bad one yet, and that yet is doing a great deal of work in that sentence."
msgstr "saka, ka tev ir reputācija. saka, ka tā vēl nav slikta, un ka tas \"vēl\" tajā teikumā paveic daudz darba."

#: script/swamp.js:114
msgid "says you have gone so many times the furnace downstairs keeps a book on it."
msgstr "saka, ka esi gājis tik daudzas reizes, ka krāsns lejā par to ved uzskaiti."

#: script/events/room.js:928
msgid "says you still have time to change what people say. says it will take longer than earning it did."
msgstr "saka, ka tev vēl ir laiks mainīt to, ko cilvēki saka. saka, ka tas prasīs ilgāk, nekā prasīja to nopelnīt."

#: script/swamp.js:119
msgid "says you were a good one, doing a thing that should not have been done, extremely well."
msgstr "saka, ka tu biji labs, ārkārtīgi labi darot lietu, kuru nevajadzēja darīt."

#: script/localization.js:45
#: script/localization.js:50
msgid "scales"
msgstr "zvīņas"

#: script/outside.js:117
msgid "scattered teeth"
msgstr "izkaisīti zobi"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1500
msgid "scavenge maps"
msgstr "atrast kartes"

#: script/events/encounters.js:239
msgid "scavenger"
msgstr "sirotājs"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4788
msgid "scavenger had a small camp in the school."
msgstr "sirotājs skolā bija ierīkojis nelielu apmetni."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4831
msgid "scavenger'd been looking for supplies in here, it seems."
msgstr "šķiet, ka sirotājs šeit meklējis krājumus."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6283
msgid "scavengers must have gotten to this place already."
msgstr "šķiet, ka te jau paspējuši pabūt sirotāji."

#: script/outside.js:1548
msgid "scavening wanderers pick over the bodies on an old battlefield. a wanderer finds a dead human in shining armor. they are disappointed they can't use the armor because it only has two arms."
msgstr "maroderojošie klejotāji pārmeklē ķermeņus senā kaujas laukā. klejotājs atrod mirušu cilvēku spīdošās bruņās. viņš ir vīlies, ka nevar izmantot bruņas, jo tām ir tikai divas rokas."

#: script/outside.js:1159
msgid "scoff at her weakness"
msgstr "izsmiet viņas vājumu"

#: script/space.js:1176
msgid "score for this game: {0}"
msgstr "šīs spēles rezultāts: {0}"

#: script/engine.js:57
#: script/events/encounters.js:565
msgid "scout"
msgstr "izlūkot"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4702
msgid "scrap plating"
msgstr "metāllūžņu bruņojums"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2149
msgid "scrape the rim"
msgstr "nokasīt malu"

#: script/events/executioner.js:403
msgid "scraps of copper wire litter the floor."
msgstr "vara vada gabali klāj grīdu."

#: script/outside.js:102
msgid "scraps of fur"
msgstr "kažokādas kušķi"

#: script/outside.js:135
msgid "scraps of iron"
msgstr "dzelzs gabali"

#: script/events/road.js:319
msgid "scratched into the underside of the rock, where somebody lying exactly here would see it, there is a line of marks."
msgstr "ieskrāpēta klints apakšpusē, kur kāds, guļot tieši šeit, to redzētu, ir zīmju rinda."

#: script/events/road.js:541
msgid "scratched on the underside of the middle stone there is a list of marks in different hands."
msgstr "ieskrāpēts vidējā akmens apakšpusē ir zīmju saraksts dažādos rokrakstos."

#: script/prison.js:231
msgid "scratches on a sloped face, made by someone lying down."
msgstr "skrāpējumi uz slīpas virsmas, ko atstājis kāds, kas gulēja."

#: script/events/room.js:223
msgid "scratching noises can be heard from the store room."
msgstr "no noliktavas skan skrāpējoši trokšņi."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:634
msgid "scribe"
msgstr "rakstvedis"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1288
msgid "sealed"
msgstr "aizzīmogots"

#: script/fabricator.js:92
msgid "sealed at every seam. the counter on the chest goes quiet."
msgstr "aizzīmogots pie katras šuves. skaitītājs uz krūtīm apklust."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1249
msgid "sealing"
msgstr "aizzīmogojot"

#: script/events/road.js:1627
msgid "search it"
msgstr "to pārmeklēt"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2945
msgid "search the records"
msgstr "pārmeklēt ierakstus"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6395
msgid "searching the bodies yields a few supplies."
msgstr "pārmeklējot mirušo ķermeņus, atrodas dažas lietas."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1010
msgid "seated one"
msgstr "sēdošais"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2160
msgid "security drones still patrol the hallways."
msgstr "drošības droni joprojām patrulē gaiteņus."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2060
msgid "security is even tighter here."
msgstr "drošība šeit ir vēl stingrāka."

#: script/engine.js:58
msgid "see farther"
msgstr "redzēt tālāk"

#: script/events/outside.js:598
msgid "see to our own dead first"
msgstr "vispirms parūpēties par saviem mirušajiem"

#: script/outside.js:1429
msgid "seeing it in their eyes. some fear or resent you. but why?"
msgstr "redzot to viņu acīs. daži tevi baidās vai nes ļaunu. bet kāpēc?"

#: script/events/executioner.js:99
msgid "self-repair"
msgstr "pašlabošanās"

#: script/events/room.js:1155
msgid "send her on"
msgstr "sūtīt viņu tālāk"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:239
msgid "sentinel"
msgstr "vērotājs sargs"

#: script/events/outside.js:258
msgid "separate the sick"
msgstr "nošķirt slimos"

#: script/events/executioner.js:59
msgid "servos spin up"
msgstr "servomotori iesāk griezties"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3485
msgid "set the three in the floor"
msgstr "ielikt trīs grīdā"

#: script/events/executioner.js:357
#: script/events/setpieces.js:7200
msgid "sets himself"
msgstr "pats sagatavojas"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5881
msgid "sets itself"
msgstr "pats sagatavojas"

#: script/mobileUI.js:299
msgid "settings"
msgstr "iestatījumi"

#: script/events/encounters.js:165
msgid "shadow"
msgstr "ēna"

#: script/events/encounters.js:157
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "Ēna"

#: script/events/room.js:1064
msgid "shamefully gather goods"
msgstr "kaunpilni vākt preces"

#: script/engine.js:854
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Dalīties"

#: script/events/room.js:59
msgid "share a meal"
msgstr "dalīties maltītē"

#: script/engine.js:231
msgid "share."
msgstr "dalīties."

#: script/events/global.js:76
msgid "shares what he knows about sneaking before he goes."
msgstr "dalās ar ko viņš zina par slapstīšanos."

#: script/room.js:1006
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make even stronger steel armour for protection."
msgstr "asi zobi, izsalkušas mutes un vardarbīgas sirdis kāro asinis. amatniece var izgatavot vēl stiprākas tērauda bruņas aizsardzībai."

#: script/room.js:971
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make stronger iron armour for protection. she likes to see you protected."
msgstr "asi zobi, izsalkušas mutes un vardarbīgas sirdis kāro asinis. amatniece var izgatavot stiprākas dzelzs bruņas aizsardzībai. viņai patīk redzēt tevi aizsargātu."

#: script/room.js:936
msgid "sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can stitch together leather armour for protection. she worries about you."
msgstr "asi zobi, izsalkušas mutes un vardarbīgas sirdis kāro asinis. amatniece var sašūt ādas bruņas aizsardzībai. viņa par tevi uztraucas."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2331
msgid "she asked you not to, and you agreed, and that is the end of it for now."
msgstr "viņa lūdza tevi to nedarīt, un tu piekriti, un pagaidām ar to viss beidzas."

#: script/builder.js:189
msgid "she asks how thick the layers were. when you tell her, she goes quiet in the specific way she goes quiet when a number means something to her that it does not mean to you."
msgstr "viņa jautā, cik biezi bija slāņi. kad tu viņai pasaki, viņa apklust tādā īpašā veidā, kā apklust, kad kāds skaitlis viņai nozīmē kaut ko, kas tev nenozīmē neko."

#: script/builder.js:193
msgid "she asks how you got in. you tell her about the six handprints and she stops what she is doing entirely. says that is not a lock, that is a quorum, and that nobody was ever meant to open that door on their own -- and then does not ask the obvious next question, and you both let her not ask it."
msgstr "viņa jautā, kā tu tiki iekšā. tu pastāsti viņai par sešiem plaukstu nospiedumiem, un viņa pilnībā pārtrauc to, ko dara. saka, ka tā nav slēdzene, tas ir kvorums, un ka nevienam nekad nebija paredzēts atvērt tās durvis vienam pašam -- un tad neuzdod acīmredzamo nākamo jautājumu, un jūs abi ļaujat viņai to neuzdot."

#: script/builder.js:185
msgid "she asks if the stars looked right. when you tell her they did not, she nods like that confirms something she already suspected and declines to say what."
msgstr "viņa jautā, vai zvaigznes izskatījās pareizi. kad tu viņai saki, ka nē, viņa pamāj, it kā tas apstiprinātu kaut ko, ko viņa jau aizdomājās, un atsakās pateikt, ko."

#: script/builder.js:169
msgid "she asks what they were like. not what they said -- what they were LIKE. says she has never been sure whether watching is a kindness or the absence of one, and that she has had a long time to decide and has not."
msgstr "viņa jautā, kādi viņi bija. ne ko viņi teica -- kādi viņi BIJA. saka, ka nekad nav bijusi pārliecināta, vai vērošana ir laipnība vai tās trūkums, un ka viņai bijis daudz laika izlemt, un viņa nav to izdarījusi."

#: script/events/road.js:1569
msgid "she asks whether it is over. told that nobody knows what \"it\" is, she says that is the correct answer and seems satisfied by it."
msgstr "viņa jautā, vai tas ir beidzies. uzzinot, ka neviens nezina, kas ir \"tas\", viņa saka, ka tā ir pareizā atbilde, un šķiet apmierināta ar to."

#: script/builder.js:197
msgid "she asks you to say the charter again, slowly, and mouths the last line along with you the second time. says she did not know anyone had written that down. says somebody should have."
msgstr "viņa lūdz tev vēlreiz teikt hartu, lēnām, un otro reizi klusi izrunā līdzi pēdējo rindu. saka, ka nezināja, ka kāds to bija pierakstījis. saka, ka kādam vajadzēja."

#: script/builder.js:142
msgid "she banks it without being asked, out of habit, before she has even said anything about it. says a fire is the first thing and the last thing, whichever world you are having this argument on."
msgstr "viņa to piesedz, bez lūguma, ieraduma pēc, pirms pat kaut ko par to teikusi. saka, ka uguns ir pirmā lieta un pēdējā lieta, lai kurā pasaulē tu par to strīdētos."

#: script/outside.js:1066
msgid "she bolts upright and awake."
msgstr "viņa strauji piecēlās sēdus un pamodās."

#: script/builder.js:221
msgid "she builds what is asked for and does not argue about it. says only that she has seen a place run this way before, and that she was not one of the people running it."
msgstr "viņa būvē to, kas tiek lūgts, un par to nestrīdas. saka tikai, ka jau redzējusi vietu, kas darbojas šādi, un ka viņa nebija viena no tiem, kas to vadīja."

#: script/builder.js:181
msgid "she checks you over before she says a word, the way she would check a wound. says glass like that does not happen on its own, and that whatever did it to the ground would have done the same to a person standing on it."
msgstr "viņa tevi apskata, pirms saka ne vārda, tā, kā apskatītu brūci. saka, ka tāds stikls nerodas pats no sevis, un ka lai kas to nodarīja zemei, būtu izdarījis to pašu ar cilvēku, kas uz tās stāv."

#: script/events/road.js:1565
msgid "she comes back slowly, the way somebody surfaces rather than wakes."
msgstr "viņa atgriežas lēni, tā, kā kāds uzniršas, nevis pamostas."

#: script/builder.js:228
msgid "she counts them twice, which does not change the number. says she does not know any of their names, and that this is the part she cannot get used to."
msgstr "viņa tos skaita divreiz, kas nemaina skaitli. saka, ka nezina nevienu no viņu vārdiem, un ka tas ir tas, kam viņa nespēj pierast."

#: script/events/room.js:1273
msgid "she does not argue. she writes something in the book, closes it, and walks."
msgstr "viņa nestrīdas. viņa kaut ko ieraksta grāmatā, aizver to un aiziet."

#: script/room.js:2143
msgid "she does not argue. that is the part worth noticing."
msgstr "viņa nestrīdas. tas ir tas, kas jāievēro."

#: script/builder.js:165
msgid "she does not ask if you are alright. she can see that you are not, entirely. says a ship like that does not get built for one purpose, and asks, quietly, which purpose found you."
msgstr "viņa nejautā, vai tev viss kārtībā. viņa redz, ka ne pilnībā. saka, ka tāds kuģis netiek būvēts vienam nolūkam, un klusi jautā, kurš nolūks tevi atrada."

#: script/builder.js:118
msgid "she does not ask what happened out there. she can see most of it. says the wastes kill people on their own without any help from us, and that maybe there is another way, and that she knows how that sounds."
msgstr "viņa nejautā, kas tur ārā notika. viņa redz lielāko daļu no tā. saka, ka tuksneši nogalina cilvēkus paši, bez mūsu palīdzības, un ka varbūt ir cits ceļš, un ka viņa zina, kā tas izklausās."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2362
msgid "she does not explain how she found you. she asks you not to open the door."
msgstr "viņa nepaskaidro, kā viņa tevi atrada. viņa lūdz tevi neatvērt durvis."

#: script/room.js:2142
msgid "she does not nod. she looks at the hut, and then at you, and then goes back to work."
msgstr "viņa nepamāj. viņa paskatās uz būdu, tad uz tevi, un tad atgriežas pie darba."

#: script/builder.js:177
msgid "she does not say i told you so, and you can see what it costs her not to. says she is glad you are standing in front of her and asks nothing else, and you understand that not asking is the kindness."
msgstr "viņa nesaka \"es taču teicu\", un tu vari redzēt, ko viņai maksā to neteikt. saka, ka priecājas, ka tu stāvi viņas priekšā, un vairāk neko nejautā, un tu saproti, ka nejautāšana ir laipnība."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1704
msgid "she does not say it unkindly. she goes back to the racks."
msgstr "viņa to nesaka nelaipni. viņa atgriežas pie statīviem."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2383
msgid "she does not say thank you. she does not say anything at all for the first hour of the walk."
msgstr "viņa nepateicas. viņa vispār neko nesaka pirmo gājiena stundu."

#: script/events/room.js:1261
msgid "she eats, and thanks the village, and has nothing to leave behind but the thanks."
msgstr "viņa ēd, un pateicas ciematam, un viņai nav nekā, ko atstāt, izņemot pateicību."

#: script/outside.js:1068
msgid "she fails to hide her anger."
msgstr "viņai neizdodas slēpt savas dusmas."

#: script/events/road.js:623
msgid "she gets the water down and then most of an hour later she can stand."
msgstr "viņa iedzer ūdeni, un tad, gandrīz stundu vēlāk, var stāvēt."

#: script/events/road.js:633
msgid "she gives up what is left in her pack, which is not much, and starts back the way she came."
msgstr "viņa atdod to, kas palicis viņas mugursomā, kas nav daudz, un dodas atpakaļ tā, kā atnāca."

#: script/builder.js:160
msgid "she goes very still when you describe him. says she knows exactly who that is, and what he signed, and that neither of those is the part that matters to her. says he was one of the two who stood up when the sentence was read. she does not say who the other one was."
msgstr "viņa kļūst pilnīgi nekustīga, kad viņu apraksti. saka, ka precīzi zina, kas tas ir, un ko viņš parakstīja, un ka neviena no šīm lietām viņai nav svarīga. saka, ka viņš bija viens no diviem, kas piecēlās, kad tika lasīts spriedums. viņa nesaka, kas bija otrs."

#: script/builder.js:218
msgid "she has been quieter since the huts went up, and it is a better quiet. says she has built for people who were being kept before. says this is not that."
msgstr "viņa ir bijusi klusāka kopš būdu uzbūvēšanas, un tas ir labāks klusums. saka, ka jau iepriekš būvējusi cilvēkiem, kas tika turēti. saka, ka šis nav tas."

#: script/events/road.js:628
msgid "she has been rationing to a schedule she wrote out beforehand. the schedule assumed the water would be where the map said."
msgstr "viņa normēja pēc grafika, ko bija uzrakstījusi iepriekš. grafiks pieņēma, ka ūdens būs tur, kur teica karte."

#: script/events/road.js:625
msgid "she has been walking east for eleven days on four days of supplies, which she is aware does not work."
msgstr "viņa jau vienpadsmit dienas staigā uz austrumiem ar krājumiem četrām dienām, un viņa apzinās, ka tas nesader."

#: script/events/road.js:626
msgid "she has been walking since a settlement that she names, and that nobody has heard of, and that she is certain is two days behind her."
msgstr "viņa staigā kopš apmetnes, ko viņa nosauc, un par kuru neviens nav dzirdējis, un par kuru viņa ir pārliecināta, ka tā ir divas dienas aiz muguras."

#: script/events/room.js:1751
msgid "she has done something to her hand and has not mentioned it, and has been working one-handed for long enough that you only notice now."
msgstr "viņa kaut ko izdarījusi savai rokai un par to nav minējusi, un jau pietiekami ilgi strādā ar vienu roku, ka tu to pamani tikai tagad."

#: script/events/room.js:1755
msgid "she has hurt her hand and said nothing"
msgstr "viņa savainojusi roku un neko nesacīja"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1724
msgid "she has more than she can use and no way to stop making it."
msgstr "viņai ir vairāk, nekā var izmantot, un nav veida, kā apturēt tā izgatavošanu."

#: script/space.js:1079
msgid "she has never mentioned being able to do that.<br>you have never seen her do anything like it."
msgstr "viņa nekad nav minējusi, ka to prot.<br>tu nekad neesi redzējis viņu darām ko līdzīgu."

#: script/outside.js:1049
msgid "she hasn't completely escaped the dream. some of the terror remains in her face."
msgstr "viņa nav pilnībā izbēgusi no sapņa. daļa šausmu paliek viņas sejā."

#: script/space.js:1007
#: script/space.js:1095
msgid "she holds it together long enough. the drives catch."
msgstr "viņa notur to kopā pietiekami ilgi. piedziņas iedegas."

#: script/builder.js:146
msgid "she is careful with it in a way she is not careful with iron or coal. says she has seen what happens when this is stored wrong, and does not say where."
msgstr "viņa ar to ir uzmanīga tā, kā nav uzmanīga ar dzelzi vai oglēm. saka, ka redzējusi, kas notiek, ja tas tiek nepareizi glabāts, un nesaka, kur."

#: script/space.js:1100
msgid "she is doing too much at once and you can see the moment it starts to come apart."
msgstr "viņa dara pārāk daudz uzreiz, un tu vari redzēt brīdi, kad tas sāk sabrukt."

#: script/builder.js:173
msgid "she is quiet for long enough that you think she is not going to say anything. then: that every name on a stone like that was a person who trusted somebody, once, right up until the point where trusting them was the mistake that killed them."
msgstr "viņa klusē pietiekami ilgi, ka tu domā, ka viņa neko neteiks. tad: ka katrs vārds uz tāda akmens bija cilvēks, kas kādreiz kādam uzticējās, tieši līdz brīdim, kad viņu uzticēšanās bija kļūda, kas viņus nogalināja."

#: script/space.js:1004
#: script/space.js:1090
msgid "she is working eight stations at once and touching none of them.<br>readouts move. locks release. the drives come up."
msgstr "viņa strādā ar astoņām stacijām vienlaikus un nevienai no tām nepieskaras.<br>rādījumi kustas. slēdzenes atveras. piedziņas ieslēdzas."

#: script/outside.js:1120
msgid "she isn't very talkative and that is fine by you."
msgstr "viņa nav ļoti runīga, un tev tas ir labi."

#: script/events/room.js:1245
msgid "she leaves three pages behind, torn out at the spine."
msgstr "viņa atstāj trīs lapas, izrautas pie iesējuma."

#: script/events/room.js:1777
msgid "she lets you do it, which takes longer than the doing."
msgstr "viņa ļauj tev to darīt, kas prasa ilgāk par pašu darbu."

#: script/builder.js:210
msgid "she listens to the whole of it without interrupting. says somebody built that, and lived in it, and is not there now. says this rock is mostly other people's endings."
msgstr "viņa visu to noklausās, nepārtraucot. saka, ka kāds to uzbūvēja, un tur dzīvoja, un tagad tur nav. saka, ka šī klints lielākoties ir citu cilvēku beigas."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1702
msgid "she looks at you for a while longer than is comfortable."
msgstr "viņa uz tevi skatās ilgāk, nekā ir ērti."

#: script/outside.js:1050
msgid "she looks away from you."
msgstr "viņa novērš skatienu no tevis."

#: script/easterEggs.js:73
msgid "she mentions, without looking up, that her name is Ayla. she does not bring it up again."
msgstr "viņa, nepaceļot skatienu, piemin, ka viņas vārds ir Ayla. viņa to vairs nepiemin."

#: script/events/room.js:1188
msgid "she nods like she expected it, and does not write anything."
msgstr "viņa pamāj, it kā to gaidījusi, un neko nepieraksta."

#: script/room.js:2128
msgid "she nods, and does not say anything for a bit, and then says good."
msgstr "viņa pamāj, kādu brīdi neko nesaka, un tad saka labi."

#: script/room.js:2113
msgid "she puts the plans down and does not pick them back up."
msgstr "viņa noliek plānus un vairs tos nepaceļ."

#: script/events/road.js:629
msgid "she said kindness is rare here, but appreciated. she heard good things of you as of late."
msgstr "viņa teica, ka laipnība šeit ir reta, taču novērtēta. viņa nesen dzirdējusi labas lietas par tevi."

#: script/events/road.js:631
msgid "she said someone found her hidden water cache and raided it. there was no contigency plan beyond that."
msgstr "viņa teica, ka kāds atradis viņas slēpto ūdens krājumu un to izlaupījis. rezerves plāna pēc tam nebija."

#: script/events/road.js:658
msgid "she says east was fine for nine days and then stopped being a direction."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka austrumi bija labi deviņas dienas, un tad pārstāja būt virziens."

#: script/events/road.js:1571
msgid "she says if you knew what she knew, you would be kneeling and holding like her."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka, ja tu zinātu to, ko viņa zina, tu klusētu ceļos un turētos kā viņa."

#: script/events/road.js:1572
msgid "she says if you wait long enough the Infinite Expanse cycle will restart."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka, ja gaidīsi pietiekami ilgi, Bezgalīgā Plašuma cikls sāksies no jauna."

#: script/events/room.js:1805
msgid "she says it is fine and you agree that it is fine and the subject is closed."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka viss kārtībā, un tu piekrīti, ka viss kārtībā, un tēma ir slēgta."

#: script/events/room.js:1753
msgid "she says it is fine. it is visibly not fine."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka viss kārtībā. redzami tas nav kārtībā."

#: script/outside.js:1236
msgid "she says it is kind kind to ask, but some things are best left unsaid."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka ir laipni jautāt, taču dažas lietas labāk atstāt nepateiktas."

#: script/events/road.js:1574
msgid "she says it is mostly silence where voices and signals once were."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka lielākoties ir klusums tur, kur kādreiz bija balsis un signāli."

#: script/events/road.js:657
msgid "she says nothing is east. says she checked."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka austrumos nav nekā. saka, ka pārbaudījusi."

#: script/events/road.js:1568
msgid "she says she is holding. she says holding is the whole of it and there is nothing after holding."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka tur. saka, ka turēšanās ir viss, un pēc turēšanās nekā nav."

#: script/events/road.js:1567
msgid "she says she is waiting to be told she can stop. she says the order has not been given."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka gaida, kad viņai teiks, ka var apstāties. saka, ka pavēle nav dota."

#: script/events/road.js:627
msgid "she says she stopped to think and could not work out how to start again. she says it took hours to notice."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka apstājās padomāt un nespēja saprast, kā sākt no jauna. saka, ka pagāja stundas, lai to pamanītu."

#: script/events/road.js:1570
msgid "she says she was told to wait here and that the person who told her was extremely clear about it."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka viņai tika teikts gaidīt šeit, un ka persona, kas to teica, bija par to ārkārtīgi skaidra."

#: script/events/room.js:1218
msgid "she says the entry is not hers. it was already in the book when the book came to her."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka ieraksts nav viņas. tas jau bija grāmatā, kad grāmata nonāca pie viņas."

#: script/events/road.js:1573
msgid "she says the Mysterious Wanderer can answer better than she can."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka Noslēpumainais Klejotājs var atbildēt labāk nekā viņa."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1694
msgid "she says the village is just over there. she gestures at a direction with nothing in it."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka ciemats ir turpat. viņa parāda virzienu, kurā nav nekā."

#: script/events/outside.js:999
msgid "she says there are a great many of these. she says she has been walking past them her whole life."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka to ir ļoti daudz. saka, ka garām tiem staigājusi visu savu dzīvi."

#: script/events/road.js:659
msgid "she says there is nothing east, and then corrects herself, and says there is nothing east that stays where it is."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka austrumos nav nekā, un tad pati sevi labo, un saka, ka austrumos nav nekā, kas paliktu tur, kur ir."

#: script/events/road.js:660
msgid "she says things that were east disappeared and other things that were east reappeared."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka lietas, kas bija austrumos, pazuda, un citas lietas, kas bija austrumos, atkal parādījās."

#: script/events/room.js:1227
msgid "she says whoever wrote it had been here long enough to stop expecting to leave."
msgstr "viņa saka, ka lai kas to rakstīja, bijis šeit pietiekami ilgi, lai vairs negaidītu aiziešanu."

#: script/outside.js:1185
msgid "she seems confused when you ask as if you should know."
msgstr "viņa šķiet apjukusi, kad jautā, it kā tev vajadzētu zināt."

#: script/outside.js:1011
#: script/outside.js:1067
msgid "she sees you there staring at her."
msgstr "viņa redz, ka tu tur uz viņu lūkojies."

#: script/outside.js:1222
msgid "she should be direct and speak up or not speak at all."
msgstr "viņai vajadzētu būt tiešai un runāt skaļi vai vispār nerunāt."

#: script/outside.js:1065
msgid "she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she screams that the exile doomed us all."
msgstr "viņa sāk runāt. viņa murmina par karu. viņa kliedz, ka izsūtītais mūs visus pazudinājis."

#: script/outside.js:1010
msgid "she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she shrieks about human blood on her hands and finally bolts upright and awake."
msgstr "viņa sāk runāt. viņa murmina par karu. viņa iekliedzas par cilvēka asinīm uz savām rokām un beidzot strauji piecēlās sēdus un pamodās."

#: script/events/road.js:685
msgid "she stopped walking a good while before she ran out of anything."
msgstr "viņa pārstāja staigāt labu laiku pirms viņai kaut kas beidzās."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1723
msgid "she takes the fur without counting it and loads you up past what the fur was worth."
msgstr "viņa paņem kažokādu, neskaitot to, un piekrauj tevi vairāk, nekā kažokāda bija vērta."

#: script/events/encounters.js:1726
msgid "she trades generously"
msgstr "viņa tirgojas devīgi"

#: script/builder.js:138
msgid "she turns the ore over in both hands before she says anything. says whoever dug this vein meant it to still be findable. says that is a strange thing to plan for, and a stranger thing to be grateful for."
msgstr "viņa apgroza rūdu abās rokās, pirms kaut ko saka. saka, ka lai kas raka šo dzīslu, gribēja, lai to joprojām var atrast. saka, ka tas ir dīvaini plānot, un vēl dīvaināk par to būt pateicīgam."

#: script/events/room.js:1169
msgid "she turns the page. there are forty names on it, in nine hands, and none of them agree."
msgstr "viņa apgriež lapu. uz tās ir četrdesmit vārdi, deviņos rokrakstos, un neviens no tiem nesaskan."

#: script/events/outside.js:995
msgid "she turns the stone over looking for a mason's mark and finds one, scratched rather than cut."
msgstr "viņa apgriež akmeni, meklējot mūrnieka zīmi, un atrod vienu, ieskrāpētu, nevis iecirstu."

#: script/events/road.js:630
msgid "she was coming to terms with the end, and now has to process what comes next."
msgstr "viņa samierinājās ar galu, un tagad jātiek galā ar to, kas nāk tālāk."

#: script/events/room.js:1167
msgid "she writes it down without looking up. asks how long that has been the name."
msgstr "viņa to pieraksta, nepaceļot skatienu. jautā, cik ilgi tas ir bijis vārds."

#: script/events/encounters.js:97
msgid "shell splits"
msgstr "čaula plaisā"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:469
msgid "shielded"
msgstr "ekranēts"

#: script/ship.js:33
msgid "Ship"
msgstr "Kuģis"

#: script/events/encounters.js:523
msgid "shivering human"
msgstr "trīcošs cilvēks"

#: script/world.js:94
msgid "shoot"
msgstr "šaut"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1295
msgid "should be able to open it."
msgstr "vajadzētu spēt to atvērt."

#: script/room.js:403
msgid "should cure the meat, or it'll spoil. builder says she can fix something up."
msgstr "gaļu jākūpina vai jāsāla, lai tā nesabojātos, un amatniece saka, ka viņai ir kas padomā."

#: script/events/road.js:609
msgid "shout and keep going"
msgstr "kliegt un turpināt iet"

#: script/events/executioner.js:515
msgid "shuffling noises can be heard from within."
msgstr "no iekšpuses dzirdami vilkšanas trokšņi."

#: script/events/outside.js:226
msgid "Sickness"
msgstr "Sērga"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1228
msgid "siege automaton"
msgstr "aplenkuma automāts"

#: script/events/road.js:1514
msgid "sight along the way they face"
msgstr "mērķēt tajā virzienā, kurp viņi vērsti"

#: script/events/path.js:123
msgid "since after the meal, they say, and then cannot agree on which meal."
msgstr "kopš pēc maltītes, viņi saka, un tad nevar vienoties, kuras maltītes."

#: script/events/road.js:1729
msgid "sit and watch it"
msgstr "apsēsties un to vērot"

#: script/events/room.js:1643
msgid "sit with it"
msgstr "apsēsties ar to"

#: script/outside.js:1064
msgid "siting in silence, ignoring the builder's suffering."
msgstr "sēžot klusumā, ignorējot amatnieces ciešanas."

#: script/outside.js:1009
msgid "sitting in silence, ignoring the builder`s suffering."
msgstr "sēžot klusumā, ignorējot amatnieces ciešanas."

#: script/events/road.js:115
msgid "sixty-one trips ended at this pile"
msgstr "sešdesmit viens brauciens beidzās pie šīs kaudzes"

#: script/events/road.js:100
#: script/events/road.js:107
msgid "sixty-one."
msgstr "sešdesmit viens."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:355
msgid "skitter"
msgstr "aizšaut projām"

#: script/world.js:76
msgid "slash"
msgstr "cirst"

#: script/outside.js:585
msgid "slave"
msgstr "vergs"

#: script/outside.js:581
msgid "slaves"
msgstr "vergi"

#: script/events/room.js:1655
msgid "sleep"
msgstr "gulēt"

#: script/world.js:88
msgid "slice"
msgstr "šķēle"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1536
msgid "slipped past an automated sentry."
msgstr "izmuka garām automātiskajam sargam."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2090
msgid "slipped through unnoticed."
msgstr "izlīda cauri nemanīts."

#: script/dropbox.js:451
msgid "slot {0}: {1}"
msgstr "slots {0}: {1}"

#: script/dropbox.js:452
msgid "slot {0}: empty"
msgstr "slots {0}: tukšs"

#: script/engine.js:37
msgid "slow metabolism"
msgstr "lēna vielmaiņa"

#: script/graveyard.js:95
msgid "small coffins weigh the heaviest"
msgstr "mazie zārki sver visvairāk"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1423
msgid "small sensors in the walls still look to be operational."
msgstr "mazie sensori sienās joprojām izskatās darbojamies."

#: script/events/executioner.js:2384
msgid "small weapons cache in a cabinet."
msgstr "skapī neliels ieroču krājums."

#: script/events/room.js:1315
msgid "smash it"
msgstr "sadauzīt to"

#: script/room.js:400
#: script/room.js:425
msgid "smokehouse"
msgstr "kūpinātava"

#: script/room.js:1489
msgid "smoldering"
msgstr "gruzdošs"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4388
#: script/events/setpieces.js:5400
msgid "snarling"
msgstr "rūcot"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1092
msgid "sniper"
msgstr "snaiperis"

#: script/events/global.js:116
msgid "so are the shelves."
msgstr "tāpat kā plaukti."

#: script/events/outside.js:113
msgid "so dependent on fire for warmth and life until it takes it away."
msgstr "tik atkarīgs no uguns siltumam un dzīvei, līdz tā to atņem."

#: script/space.js:1111
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>some wanderer ships. some others.<br>sky begins to clear into an endless expanse."
msgstr "tik daudz gruvešu no mirušiem kuģiem senu, zaudētu karu.<br>daži klejotāju kuģi. daži citi.<br>debesis sāk noskaidroties bezgalīgā plašumā."

#: script/space.js:1065
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>the sky opens out, and there is nobody aboard but the two of you."
msgstr "tik daudz gruvešu no mirušiem kuģiem senu, zaudētu karu.<br>debesis atveras, un uz klāja nav neviena, izņemot jūs abus."

#: script/room.js:2091
msgid "so they have somewhere to be kept"
msgstr "lai viņiem būtu, kur tikt turētiem"

